            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.22+EXO.4.23+EXO.4.24+EXO.4.25+EXO.4.26+EXO.4.27+EXO.4.28+EXO.4.29+EXO.4.30+EXO.4.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 4.22-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkani woli qit'aani jennaani AABBO Waaqi ilmaani d'iira ta angafa ta lafa Misiri keesa jirtu, gurba Farao ka angafa ka sila hayyooma isaa d'aalu iti keeyate, much'a angafa ka abbaani isa mana iti nama hid'ani keesa jiruti d'aabe ch'ufa fit'e; ammalle ilme horiini goroomuma d'ale ch'ufa hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao, hojattu isaati, worri Misiri ch'ufti halkani lafaa kae aka hama bohani; wonti akanatiifi lafa Misiri keesa mani tokoleeni ka nami keesa induiini injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkanuma suni Faraoni Musafi Haruniti nama erge waan jed'eeni, Kaa, lafa tiyya keesaa yaa, lafa tiyya keesa intaiina, isanifi worri Israeli ch'ufti aka baantani AABBO Waaqa kad'achu d'aqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reefi looni keesanile fud'ad'a yaa, nale eebisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
