          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli Ramesesi godaane lafa Sukothitini bahe. Worri nami d'iira ka miilaani yae nama kuma d'ibba jaa, ka nad'eenifi ijoolleeni keesa injirre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami gosa d'ibileeni, gumiini guddooni muumme inqamne, ta reefi loonile qabdu, worra woliini godaante. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri qit'a bukho inqamne ka lafa Misiri keesaa fud'ate kaani d'aabate; wonti akanatiifi worra lafa Misiri keesaa, ato worri inkurfefatiinu, gussani, yo qit'a bukhefatanifi yo woreega fud'atanile d'abani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
